@startuml
title Start sequence; Refresh sequence
actor Caller
participant stm32n6xx_ll_iwdg as LL
participant "IWDG registers" as REGS
== Start sequence ==
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_EnableWriteAccess()
LL -> REGS : IWDG_KR.KEY
LL --> Caller : void
note right : Enable write access to PR, RLR and WINR registers before setting values.
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_SetPrescaler(prescaler)
LL -> REGS : IWDG_PR.PR
LL --> Caller : void
note right : Set desired prescaler value in IWDG_PR.PR field.
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_SetReloadCounter(counter)
LL -> REGS : IWDG_RLR.RL
LL --> Caller : void
note right : Set the reload counter value in IWDG_RLR.RL field.
loop caller-bounded, until PVU flag is set
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_IsActiveFlag_PVU()
LL -> REGS : IWDG_SR.PVU
LL --> Caller : uint32_t
end
note right : Poll for prescaler update complete before enabling watchdog.
loop caller-bounded, until RVU flag is set
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_IsActiveFlag_RVU()
LL -> REGS : IWDG_SR.RVU
LL --> Caller : uint32_t
end
note right : Poll for reload update complete after setting the counter value.
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_Enable()
LL -> REGS : IWDG_KR.KEY
LL --> Caller : void
note right : Write enable key to start the IWDG.
== Refresh sequence ==
Caller -> LL : LL_IWDG_ReloadCounter()
LL -> REGS : IWDG_KR.KEY
LL --> Caller : void
note right : Write refresh key to restart the watchdog countdown timer.
@enduml
